OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after woman found
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a woman was found stabbed
OL,8,Fto death in a street in Manchester.
OL,10,FThe woman, aged in her 20s, was
OL,11,Fpronounced dead at the scene after
OL,12,Fpolice responded to a "disturbance" on
OL,13,FDorking Avenue in the Newton Heath area
OL,14,Fof the city at about 02:00 BST.
OL,16,FA 25-year-old man was being questioned
OL,17,Fwhile another man, 61 and woman, 38,
OL,18,Fwere arrested on suspicion of assisting
OL,19,Fan offender, Greater Manchester Police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
